# i18n

- Locales: `vi` (default), `en`. Use `next-intl` App Router setup.
- UI chrome strings in `messages/vi.json` and `messages/en.json` — keep key trees identical.
- After adding keys, run `npm run harness:i18n` (or full `npm run harness`).
- Locale switcher must preserve path (apartment slug strategy: shared slug or localized slug map — pick one and stick to it).
- Do not mix hardcoded Vietnamese/English in components; use `useTranslations` / `getTranslations`.
